        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The motto of W.A.PU Space Orderty is — running a business doesn't have to be a hassle or tiring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/47390ea2a6a18a5bf0863ab6e63fe0d0.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/47390ea2a6a18a5bf0863ab6e63fe0d0.avif?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve just launched your very own interstellar freight venture. Each day holds a simple joy: stacking parcels with care, ensuring the cargo ship lifts off steady, and reaping the rewards of a job well done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.poster.avif?t=1754640190\" width=1246 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.webm?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.mp4?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stir the vintage cargo management system to life whenever you wish; spruce up your vessel with a quick upgrade; and wonder, who shall don the captain’s hat today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/e5e6f531fd1c777f8c6d9e1d7d473314.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/e5e6f531fd1c777f8c6d9e1d7d473314.avif?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lonely expanse of stars, what tales of longing and sentiment linger within each freight  Email?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.poster.avif?t=1754640190\" width=1600 height=898 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.webm?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.mp4?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might these small, steady efforts be enough to help your sister—always ready to lend a hand—chase her dream of forming a band?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/119eee77c4712c0dc68977e3f75adb76.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/119eee77c4712c0dc68977e3f75adb76.webp?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=517 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, may you pause or return as you please, mastering your time in a universe that never hurries.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The motto of W.A.PU Space Orderty is — running a business doesn't have to be a hassle or tiring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/47390ea2a6a18a5bf0863ab6e63fe0d0.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/47390ea2a6a18a5bf0863ab6e63fe0d0.avif?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve just launched your very own interstellar freight venture. Each day holds a simple joy: stacking parcels with care, ensuring the cargo ship lifts off steady, and reaping the rewards of a job well done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.poster.avif?t=1754640190\" width=1246 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.webm?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.mp4?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stir the vintage cargo management system to life whenever you wish; spruce up your vessel with a quick upgrade; and wonder, who shall don the captain’s hat today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/e5e6f531fd1c777f8c6d9e1d7d473314.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/e5e6f531fd1c777f8c6d9e1d7d473314.avif?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lonely expanse of stars, what tales of longing and sentiment linger within each freight  Email?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.poster.avif?t=1754640190\" width=1600 height=898 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.webm?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.mp4?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might these small, steady efforts be enough to help your sister—always ready to lend a hand—chase her dream of forming a band?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/119eee77c4712c0dc68977e3f75adb76.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/119eee77c4712c0dc68977e3f75adb76.webp?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=517 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, may you pause or return as you please, mastering your time in a universe that never hurries.</p>",
